  "body": "Part of OpenProject 2098 (https://openproject.home.romaine.life/wp/2098). Until now this repo ran no CI on pull requests, so a change was first built when a release was cut after merging. Every pull request now runs the build (plus `go vet`); the release path is unchanged, and the upload step is skipped on pull requests. This check becomes a required status on `main` through a repo ruleset once this merges.\n",
